/-
# Lower density of the set generated by `2x + 1`, `3x + 1`, `6x + 1` (Erdős Problem 1134)

Erdős Problem 1134: let `A ⊆ ℕ` be the smallest set containing `1` and closed under `x ↦ 2x + 1`, `x
↦ 3x + 1` and `x ↦ 6x + 1`. Does `A` have positive lower density?
-/

module

public import Batteries.Util.ProofWanted
public import MathlibExt.Data.Set.Density

@[expose] public section

namespace MathlibExt.NumberTheory.KlarnerClosureLowerDensityErdosProblem1134Wanted

/-!
Source: T. F. Bloom, Erdős Problems, Problem #1134, https://www.erdosproblems.com/1134 (status
DISPROVED (LEAN)). UnsolvedMath record UM-30007176 (`EP-1134`), dataset ulamai/UnsolvedMath v1.8.0.

The smallest such set is the intersection of all sets containing `1` and closed under the three
maps. Lower density is the repository's `Set.lowerDensity` (liminf of `|A ∩ [0, N)| / N`). Compared
with the formal-conjectures statement `ErdosProblems/1134.lean` (equivalent; no code imported).
-/

/-- The smallest set of natural numbers that contains `1` and is closed under `x ↦ 2x + 1`,
`x ↦ 3x + 1` and `x ↦ 6x + 1`: the intersection of all such sets. -/
def klarnerSet : Set ℕ :=
  ⋂₀ {S : Set ℕ | 1 ∈ S ∧ ∀ x ∈ S, 2 * x + 1 ∈ S ∧ 3 * x + 1 ∈ S ∧ 6 * x + 1 ∈ S}

/-- Erdős Problem 1134: the set has positive lower density. -/
def klarnerSetPositiveLowerDensity : Prop :=
  0 < klarnerSet.lowerDensity

/--
Resolved false: Crampin and Hilton proved `|A ∩ [1, X]| ≪ X^{τ + o(1)}` with `τ ≈ 0.900626 < 1` (the
positive root of `6^{-τ} + ∑_{k ≥ 0} (3·2^k)^{-τ} = 1`), so `A` has density `0`;
erdosproblems.com/1134 lists the problem as disproved. Source: T. F. Bloom, Erdős Problems, Problem
#1134, https://www.erdosproblems.com/1134 (status DISPROVED (LEAN)); resolution: Crampin and Hilton,
reported in D. A. Klarner, A sufficient condition for certain semigroups to be free, J. Algebra
(1982), 140-148; proof in J. C. Lagarias, Erdős, Klarner, and the 3x+1 problem, Amer. Math. Monthly
123 (2016), 753-776, erdosproblems.com/1134: |A ∩ [1, X]| ≪ X^{τ + o(1)} with τ ≈ 0.900626 the
positive root of 6^{-τ} + ∑_{k ≥ 0} (3·2^k)^{-τ} = 1.
-/
public theorem_wanted klarnerSetPositiveLowerDensity_refuted : ¬ klarnerSetPositiveLowerDensity

end MathlibExt.NumberTheory.KlarnerClosureLowerDensityErdosProblem1134Wanted
